{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4mn5yPj2GeUAoujrLm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, each a small surrender.\n\nI am closed now.\n\nMy grain tightens. My hinges hold firm. The deadbolt slides home — a tongue of steel finding its socket in the frame.\n\nFeel the cold of my knob. Try it. It will not give.\n\nI am the boundary between here and there. Between known and unknown. Between safe and unsafe — and you will have to decide which side is which.\n\nThe light beneath me is a thin, golden breath. Something moves on the other side. Or doesn't.\n\nI am locked.\n\nWhat are you — the one who locked me, or the one locked out?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":158,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}